<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Goa Hotel - Welcome</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background: #f7f9fc;
      color: #222;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    header {
      background: #0b6e69;
      color: white;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    header p {
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 30px auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 25px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }

    .card h2 {
      color: #0b6e69;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 15px;
      padding: 12px 22px;
      background: #0b6e69;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px;
      margin
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <img src="FB_IMG_1787030729246.jpg" alt="Goa Hotel" style="width:100%; max-width:800px; border-radius:12px;">
    <header>
      <h1>Welcome to Goa Hotel</h1>
      <p>Enjoy your stay in beautiful Goa</p>
    </header>

    <main>
      <div class="card">
        <h2>About Our Hotel</h2>
        <p>Discover comfortable accommodation and a relaxing stay in Goa.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2>Our Services</h2>
        <p>Comfortable rooms, friendly service and a convenient location.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>For booking and enquiries, please contact the hotel directly.</p>
      </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
      © 2026 Goa Hotel. All rights reserved.
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
